## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design isolation in software-defined networking within a Linux multi-tenant ingest stack, focusing on practical BPF/XDP, NIC tuning, and QoS.

## Key Concepts
- XDP/BPF for flow-level tenant routing
- Per-tenant queuing and pacing
- cgroups v2 IO control and CPU affinity
- NIC offloads and kernel tuning for latency

